// Regression fixture for the OTHER direction: the injection added in PR #1
// uses `injectionSelector: "L:source.mfront -comment -string"`. The `L:`
// prefix is what lets the keyword rules reach into nested scopes, but
// without `-comment -string` the injection also reaches inside comments and
// string literals, re-highlighting keywords that are not live code.
//
// Commented-out keywords are common in real .mfront files (toggling
// @UseQt, @Profiling, etc.), so this must stay excluded.

@DSL Implicit;
@Behaviour KeywordsInComments;

// @UseQt true;
// @Profiling true;

/* @Integrator is mentioned in a block comment and must not be highlighted */

@Parameter real theta = 1.0;

@Epsilon 1.e-14;
